### TrueSkill HRMS — REST smoke requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 98765 43210",
  "password": "Passw0rd@123"
}

### Verify email (paste token from the console log / email link)
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE" }

### Login (email or Employee Code)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "john.doe@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd@123" }

### Me
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Change password
POST {{base}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "oldPassword": "Passw0rd@123", "newPassword": "NewPassw0rd@123" }

### Forgot password
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "john.doe@example.com" }

### Refresh
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}" }

### ─── Phase 2 features (use the admin login token) ───
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "admin@trueskill.com", "password": "Admin@1234" }

@token = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Profile
GET {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update profile
PUT {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "TrueSkill HR Admin", "phone": "+91 90000 00000", "address": "HQ", "pincode": "110001" }

### Attendance check-in
POST {{base}}/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leave balance
GET {{base}}/leaves/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Apply leave
POST {{base}}/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "CL", "startDate": "2026-06-10", "endDate": "2026-06-11", "remarks": "Personal" }

### Create a task
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Review onboarding docs", "priority": "HIGH" }

### Issue a salary slip (HR)
POST {{base}}/salary-slips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "PASTE_USER_ID", "month": 6, "year": 2026, "gross": 50000, "deductions": 5000 }

### Publish a notice (HR)
POST {{base}}/notices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Office closed Friday", "body": "The office will remain closed this Friday for maintenance." }

### Notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
